Open Vanilla 0016: Herald picks fights he can win alone. When a character plays solo on the realm's
bot AI (Herald / self-bot), the grind target skips mobs more than 2 levels up (3 for a quest mob)
and mobs that two or more idle aggressive mobs would join: those whose own aggro radius
(Unit::GetAttackDistance + 3 yd) covers the target, and patrols within 30 yd (three for a quest
mob); one such mob makes the target count as farther away, so lone mobs come first. File in the
PlayerBots module (src/modules/PlayerBots).

